---
import StaticSubmissionForm from "../components/StaticSubmissionForm.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Correct or update a listing"
  description="Report an inaccurate or outdated software listing and provide current first-party evidence for an independent editorial review."
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: "Update a listing" }]}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Evidence-led corrections</p>
      <h1>Correct or update a listing</h1>
      <p class="measure">
        Explain what changed and link to current official evidence. Commercial
        status does not affect whether a supported correction is accepted.
      </p>
      <div class="prose measure">
        <h2>Make the correction precise</h2>
        <p>Link to the current official page or documentation and identify the exact statement that needs changing. Useful evidence can establish a published price, product capability, supported region, contract term or contact route. It does not automatically establish legal compliance, real-world performance or suitability for every church.</p>
        <h2>What we will do</h2>
        <p>We compare the evidence with the current profile, update supported factual information and preserve material questions where they remain unresolved. A correction cannot require a favourable assessment, removal of a fair limitation or a change in ranking. Please do not include personal, pastoral, safeguarding or financial information.</p>
        <p>We may contact the source, request a more precise public reference or leave the existing wording in place if the evidence is unclear. The aim is a record a church can interrogate, rather than a supplier-approved marketing page.</p>
      </div>
      <StaticSubmissionForm kind="update" />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
